      "rationale": "A factor such as local vibration, humidity, or electromagnetic interference could selectively influence the resonator_obs setup, producing the observed upward bias while leaving resonator_lab unchanged.",
      "evidenceFor": [522649, 276488, 832490, 792737, 558082, 325257, 199526, 277025, 118153, 427334, 311122, 194253],
