      "probability": 0.20,
      "rationale": "A systematic offset introduced during data acquisition, conversion, or logging could produce the apparent drift; the absence of similar anomalies in other instruments supports a procedural cause.",
      "evidenceFor": [522649, 276488, 832490, 792737, 558082, 325257, 199526, 277025, 118153, 427334, 311122, 194253],
      "evidenceAgainst": []
    },
    {
      "label": "Genuine physical change affecting resonator frequency",
